{#- The table comes from src/_data/podsHallOfFame.json, which scripts/pods-hall-of-fame.mjs rebuilds from dblp before every build. -#}
{%- set hof = podsHallOfFame %}
<p>This table lists the authors with {{ hof.minPapers }} or more papers in PODS (inspired by the ISCA Hall of Fame). It is recounted from <a href="https://dblp.org/db/conf/pods/">dblp</a> every time the site is published, most recently on {{ hof.generated | date }}, and covers {{ hof.papers }} papers from {{ hof.firstYear }} to {{ hof.lastYear }}.</p>

<p>Papers are counted by conference year. Since 2024, PODS papers appear in the PODS issues of <em>Proceedings of the ACM on Management of Data</em> (PACMMOD), and keynotes and tutorials in the PODS Companion; both are counted, as the proceedings were before. Award notices, editorials, forewords, errata and obituaries are not. Authors are matched by their dblp profile, so a wrong count usually means a dblp profile needs fixing. If you suspect an error, please <a href="{{ site.repo }}/issues/new">let us know</a>.</p>

<table class="t-hof">
  <thead><tr><th class="t-num"># Papers</th><th>Name</th>{% for d in hof.decades %}<th class="t-num">{{ d.label }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for a in hof.authors %}
    <tr><td class="t-num t-total">{{ a.total }}</td><td><a href="{{ a.dblp }}.html">{{ a.name }}</a></td>{% for n in a.perDecade %}<td class="t-num">{{ n or "" }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
